    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="186" width="380" height="40">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5"><p>球棍 / 填充 / 线框三种视图，浏览器内可旋转、切换视角观察官能团。</p></content>
