      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5"><p>帧带时间戳与键状态，以键的透明度区分成键、断键与稳定态，前端按时间戳播放。</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="340" width="380" height="26">
